\s1 A Warning to the Priests
\p \v 1 \rb “And now|וְעַתָּ֗ה\rb* \rb this|הַזֹּ֖את\rb* \rb decree|הַמִּצְוָ֥ה\rb* \rb is for you,|אֲלֵיכֶ֛ם\rb* \rb O priests:|הַכֹּהֲנִֽים׃\rb*
